'''Summer Break Cats''' (ねこのなつやすみ, ''Neko no Natsuyasumi'', '''Cats' Summer Vacation''') is the third part of the trilogy Summer event in [[The Battle Cats]], the first part being [[Summer Break Cats Paradise]] and the second part being [[Summer Break Cats Castaway]]. Added in [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]], it later received more content in Versions [[Version 11.7 Update|11.7]], [[Version 12.5 Update|12.5]], [[Version 13.5 Update|13.5]], [[Version 13.6 Update|13.6]], [[Version 14.5 Update|14.5]] and [[Version 15.5 Update|15.5]].

==Event Information==
An unforgettable summer begins!<br>
Limited Summer Break Cats event on now!

{{Color|#CC4125|'''On from August 28th (11:00am) until September 18th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Use Cat Scratcher Cards for a chance at free Cat Food every week!'''}}<br>
Scratch off one Cat Scratcher card per week for three weeks for a chance at huge Cat Food rewards!


{{Color|#CC4125|'''Chance #1: August 28th (11:00am) until September 3rd (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#CC4125|'''Chance #2: September 4th (11:00am) until September 10th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#CC4125|'''Chance #3: September 11th (11:00am) until September 18th (10:59am)'''}}

Be sure to claim all three chances for a maximum possible total of {{Color|#4A86E8|'''450 Cat Food'''}} in prizes!<br>
Try your luck and get that sweet, sweet Cat Food!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Summer Break Cats Returns Event Capsules!'''}}<br>
Draw from the Event Capsules using {{Color|#FF9900|'''Legend Nets'''}}!<br>
Collect {{Color|#9900FF|'''NEW'''}} Special Unit {{Color|#9900FF|'''Ancient Egg: N208'''}}!

Rewards: {{Color|#38761D|'''4 limited units, XP, battle items, and more!'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> The Event Capsules can only be used with Event Tickets earned in-game.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Event Capsules will be unavailable after the event ends, and Event Tickets will be unusable.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Unused Event Tickets cannot be converted into items or XP.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Summer Break Cats Returns Limited Maps!'''}}<br>
Take a stroll in the countryside in limited maps!

Visit the Legend Stages/Event Stages during this event to test your Cats in these limited stages!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Gauntlet Map - "Summer Break Cats"'''}}<br>
Enjoy the bug-filled countryside and collect Legend Nets!

Rewards: {{Color|#45818E|'''Legend Nets'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Once all stage attempts have been used, you will be able to retry after a certain amount of time has passed.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Cooldown times can be skipped by using a Catamin A item.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited Map: "Summer Diary" returns!'''}}<br>
Summer break brings with it summer festivals!

Rewards: {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Rare unit Awa-Odori Cat'''}}<br>
Timed Score Rewards: {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, battle items'''}}, and more!<br>
{{Color|#CC4125|'''On from September 4th (11:00am) until September 18th (10:59am)!'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance of unlocking this character.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> This character cannot be unlocked again if earned from a previous event.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> The unit(s) above can be activated at the Upgrade menu once collected.<br>
※ Tap the Timed Score button at the bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited Map: "Summer Night, Homeward Bound" available Week 2!'''}}<br>
Night streets can be scary, and more so in the countryside.

Timed Score Rewards: {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Legend Net, Cat Ticket, battle items'''}}

※ Tap the Timed Score button at the bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited Map: "Summer Lesson" available Week 3!'''}}<br>
Summer break isn't all fun! Don't forget your homework!<br>
Use the Lucky Tickets by selecting the Lucky Capsules tab at the Cat Capsules in the Cat Base!

Reward(s): {{Color|#00AA00|'''Lucky Ticket'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''On from September 11th (11:00am) until September 18th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#783F04|'''・Limited Map: "The School Bell Tolls" available Week 3!'''}}<br>
There isn't much time left! Finish up your project before summer ends!

Reward(s): {{Color|#45818E|'''Rare Ticket, Legend Nets'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''On from September 11th (11:00am) until September 18th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited Missions and Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''"Summer Break Cats Returns" Special Missions'''}}<br>
Reward(s): {{Color|#45818E|'''Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, Legend Nets, XP'''}}

{{Color|#4A86E8|'''"Extra Credit" Special Missions'''}}<br>
Earn rewards by clearing specific stages under specific conditions!<br>
Rewards: {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Catseye (Dark)'''}}

