<nowiki>*</nowiki> Two sets of ① Missions will appear after clearing both the "River Acheron" and "King Wahwah's Return" maps.<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Chance #2: September 11th (11:00 AM) until September 18th, 2026 (10:59 AM)'''}}<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Two sets of ② Missions will appear after clearing "Queen's Condemnation" and Into the Future Ch. 1.

{{Color|#8E7CC3|'''Earn up to 21 Summer Homework Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Reward(s): {{Color|#45818E|'''Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, Legend Nets'''}}

※ Limited-time Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until the end of the event. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> You must clear specific stages for Summer Homework Special Missions to appear.


{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●And many more Summer Break Cats Returns events to enjoy!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
You can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#0000FF|'''XP Harvest'''}} for huge XP rewards!<br>
Earn TONS of XP and power up your units to new heights!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Treasure Festivals Everyday!'''}}<br>
During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates in Story Mode chapters for a special Treasure Festival, all day every day!

Collect Treasures to gain effects that will help in battle and other scenarios!

Treasure Fest is available in {{Color|#0000FF|'''Empire of Cats on even days'''}}, {{Color|#9900FF|'''Into the Future on odd days'''}}, and {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos every three days'''}}!

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Treasure Fest is available after clearing the "Korea" stage of Empire of Cats, Ch. 1.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Check the Event Calendar for event availability.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Half-off Energy costs for double the play time!'''}}<br>
Stages in {{Color|#00AA00|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Into the Future'''}}, {{Color|#9900FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}}, {{Color|#CC4125|'''Stories of Legend'''}}, and {{Color|#CC4125|'''Uncanny Legends'''}} have their energy costs halved!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Avoid losing energy after a defeat!'''}}<br>
During this event, lose no energy after a Defeat in a certain stage like Crazed, Manic, XP Blitz, Advent, Ultimate, or Invasion!<br>
Now's your chance to push through any particularly challenging stages without fear of losing precious energy!

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Stages where a defeat will not cost you energy will be denoted with a special icon.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Energy will still be lost after suffering a defeat in a Continuation stage.

