==First Appearance==
===English Version===
*August 30, 2021 to September 20, 2021

===Japanese Version===
*July 21, 2021 to September 1, 2021

{{Gallery|GatyaitemD 158 f}}

==Trivia==
*Summer Break Cats' Japanese name, Neko no Natsuyasumi (ねこのなつやすみ, "Cats' Summer Vacation"), may be a reference to the game ''[[wikipedia:Boku no Natsuyasumi|Boku no Natsuyasumi]]''. The [[Media:Summerbreakcatsen.png|original event banner]] also looks similar to ''Boku no Natsuyasumi''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s box art.
*The [[Media:Eve l 078 11 en.png|event poster]] for the 2023 Summer Break Cats event appears to have foreshadowed [[Kappy Kawano]], based on how it shows a cat using a cucumber as fishing bait and how closely it was shown to [[Invasion of the Swamplord]]'s release.

